{
    "word": "aporia",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d36ca907-6526-3b86-b083-9ea37b071b37",
                "word": "aporia",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "315e5fca-e485-436f-9e19-b43164638c91",
                        "entry_id": "d36ca907-6526-3b86-b083-9ea37b071b37",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "aporias"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0e923c5-ce8f-32f1-a34e-dab3196aeb37",
                        "entry_id": "d36ca907-6526-3b86-b083-9ea37b071b37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An expression of deliberation with oneself regarding uncertainty or doubt as to how to proceed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rhetoric"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0215aa74-da71-4957-860d-1a5a4d615ba5",
                                "sense_id": "f0e923c5-ce8f-32f1-a34e-dab3196aeb37",
                                "text": "Aporia oft in doubt and fear will rest,\nAnd reason with itself what may be best."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "51fbab24-17ec-4aa4-b7b6-279efec4800b",
                                "sense_id": "f0e923c5-ce8f-32f1-a34e-dab3196aeb37",
                                "text": "Meanings are superposed in an aporia – not ‘either/or’, but ‘and/and’."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2618bc9-a6dc-458b-a155-53cce4d7231b",
                                "sense_id": "f0e923c5-ce8f-32f1-a34e-dab3196aeb37",
                                "text": "What they intend sickens and frightens them, and they can never speak of it directly. Instead, wrapped in whispers are ellipses, euphemisms, mumbled aporia followed by throat-clearing and a brisk change of subject."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8e011b54-bec7-3fd0-9815-4a8633f59d8c",
                        "entry_id": "d36ca907-6526-3b86-b083-9ea37b071b37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An insoluble contradiction, especially in a text's meaning; a logical impasse suggested by a text or speaker."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "73b5a6de-f32d-408a-a99e-b8e8f0fe1481",
                                "sense_id": "8e011b54-bec7-3fd0-9815-4a8633f59d8c",
                                "text": "EL James's multimillion selling series of novels ‘encodes the aporias of heterosexual relationships’, according to Professor Eva Illouz[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fd473ae-2568-4344-8641-0372c1461d35",
                                "sense_id": "8e011b54-bec7-3fd0-9815-4a8633f59d8c",
                                "text": "But Green issues are already a contested zone, already a site where politicization is being fought for. In what follows, I want to stress two other aporias in capitalist realism, which are not yet politicized to anything like the same degree. The first is mental health."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d6c238d-355c-46d2-aede-2f761428735e",
                                "sense_id": "8e011b54-bec7-3fd0-9815-4a8633f59d8c",
                                "text": "Plato believed that the core impulse to philosophizing lies in aporia, the point at which, in struggling to understand a phenomenon or answer a question, we come up against a seemingly irresolvable contradiction."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "65a3e458-045d-4dec-8972-a9d77c37a28b",
                        "source_entry_id": "d36ca907-6526-3b86-b083-9ea37b071b37",
                        "source_sense_description": "expression of doubt",
                        "target_lang_word": "twijfel",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "twijfel",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03a67597-e46e-3265-a7e8-2b7207a1809f",
                                        "entry_id": "ca4042f2-48bb-3342-9554-a48704d1913a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "innerlijke staat van onzekerheid ten aanzien van wat men in een gegeven situatie moet beslissen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1eb764ce-55c7-4103-89b8-4ffbf8a97f72",
                                                "sense_id": "03a67597-e46e-3265-a7e8-2b7207a1809f",
                                                "text": "Twijfel maakte zich van hem meester."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c065370-da5d-4f72-bab6-65629b85f762",
                                                "sense_id": "03a67597-e46e-3265-a7e8-2b7207a1809f",
                                                "text": "Nu moet blijken of de aanstormende knapen mannen zijn geworden en de grote mannen grote mannen zijn gebleven. Het is veelzeggend dat Vincenzo Nibali, zonder twijfel behorend tot de laatste categorie, pas hierna bepaalt of hij vol voor het geel in Parijs gaat of dat hij voortaan mikt op ritwinst."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85dbb27c-ecbd-4cf0-ae1c-3ba73772c4d3",
                                                "sense_id": "03a67597-e46e-3265-a7e8-2b7207a1809f",
                                                "text": "Ik vond er meer ruimte voor eigen interpretatie, twijfel en discussie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "twijfel",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aef21882-10f1-3eaa-8eaa-a47c17f27635",
                                        "entry_id": "9f0553cf-053a-378b-826a-516f3f703e8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eerste persoon enkelvoud tegenwoordige tijd van twijfelen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05ff3ffd-3437-420b-b3ea-b2a409fcc723",
                                                "sense_id": "aef21882-10f1-3eaa-8eaa-a47c17f27635",
                                                "text": "Ik twijfel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f520716-1871-3181-ba05-959b280a0f5e",
                                        "entry_id": "9f0553cf-053a-378b-826a-516f3f703e8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "gebiedende wijs van twijfelen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb76d984-5e8e-463d-9bb7-6c4246ee8997",
                                                "sense_id": "7f520716-1871-3181-ba05-959b280a0f5e",
                                                "text": "Twijfel!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ae17300-7ade-3570-8977-123a49bec473",
                                        "entry_id": "9f0553cf-053a-378b-826a-516f3f703e8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "tweede persoon enkelvoud tegenwoordige tijd van twijfelen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "inversion"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79d72993-9760-4f8b-a0db-cc514791de35",
                                                "sense_id": "8ae17300-7ade-3570-8977-123a49bec473",
                                                "text": "Twijfel je?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cdfe073f-cfd6-408a-b4c9-90b8f58ca1df",
                        "source_entry_id": "d36ca907-6526-3b86-b083-9ea37b071b37",
                        "source_sense_description": "expression of doubt",
                        "target_lang_word": "onzekerheid",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "onzekerheid",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f42ff378-a91d-3138-85ce-ac8fe400a005",
                                        "entry_id": "440f15dd-0a6b-3412-ba0f-a71fb01d2580",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het niet (helemaal) zeker zijn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa13d99f-828d-4b28-9c02-48ada7dc3a4b",
                                                "sense_id": "f42ff378-a91d-3138-85ce-ac8fe400a005",
                                                "text": "Hij twijfelt altijd want hij heeft last van te grote onzekerheid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5b6f472-83c3-411e-8fd6-1be6f9dd924d",
                                                "sense_id": "f42ff378-a91d-3138-85ce-ac8fe400a005",
                                                "text": "Mijn onzekerheid werd steeds intenser en instinctief had ik nog maar één behoefte: vluchten, weg uit de bergen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "969999ea-bf6c-4ec4-8d31-830861008a61",
                                                "sense_id": "f42ff378-a91d-3138-85ce-ac8fe400a005",
                                                "text": "Maar Christa vond tegelijkertijd dat er een groot en ongekend potentieel was voor zo'n populistische partij, op dit moment zwierven er misschien een miljoen mensen in totale onzekerheid rond."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19a787d2-aaba-31d7-95fa-48d617efb09a",
                                        "entry_id": "440f15dd-0a6b-3412-ba0f-a71fb01d2580",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "de mate waarin meting en het gemetene van elkaar kunnen afwijkingen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77adcc96-1ef1-4af6-9aeb-78bca5da00fe",
                                                "sense_id": "19a787d2-aaba-31d7-95fa-48d617efb09a",
                                                "text": "Hij is 1.80 meter lang met een onzekerheid van 1 cm."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
